RUN: not %COMPILE --error-format clang build plc.json 2>&1 | %CHECK %s

A source without an execution order is not targetable; a fault on it is located
at the consuming block and the pin it enters through: `<order>:<pin>`.
CHECK: {{.*}}expression_pin.cfc.expression_pin:0:0: error[E083]: Unsupported CFC expression: `a1 + 1`
CHECK: error: Compilation aborted due to critical errors
